#==============================================================================================
#
#   animation_effect_1 - Animations::AnimationEffect: timing properties, normalization and
#                        the local and active times
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Animations/AnimationEffect.cpp (lines 1-460) with the inline
#       members of AnimationEffect.h, by region p4a: the CSS-to-bindings fill mode and
#       direction conversions, getTiming() and getComputedTiming(), the intrinsic iteration
#       duration, converting a time-based animation to a proportional one, normalizing the
#       specified timing, updateTiming(), the animation direction, the end time, local time,
#       active duration and the active time with a fill mode. Part 2 has the phases and
#       progress, the constructor, and AnimationUpdateContext.
